# ==============================================================================
*.aux
*.bbl
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.nav
*.out
*.snm
*.synctex.gz
*.toc

# ==============================================================================
# Project-specific (added 2026-11-15)
# ==============================================================================
# Local virtual environments under other names
.venv*/
venv*/
# Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints/
# Fold caches of the evaluation (rebuilt from the training rows on demand)
retrieval_v2/evaluation/folds_cache/
# Temporary files the learned store writes before an atomic replace
selflearn/store/*.tmp
# Note: the learned store itself (selflearn/store/learned.jsonl) is TRACKED on purpose.
# Note: *.npy above is ignored by default, but the frozen embeddings (paper_embeddings.npy,
# entity_embeddings_v2.npy) are tracked explicitly and stay tracked.
